--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -22,3 +22,15 @@ Things you may want to cover:
 * Deployment instructions
 
 * ...
+
+## Inbound email
+
+Inbound mail is accepted through the Action Mailbox relay ingress at
+`POST /rails/action_mailbox/relay/inbound_emails`. Configure the relay with
+HTTP Basic auth using username `actionmailbox` and the password from
+`RAILS_INBOUND_EMAIL_PASSWORD`.
+
+Businesses receive mail at `<subdomain>@HELPDESK_SUPPORT_DOMAIN`, where
+`HELPDESK_SUPPORT_DOMAIN` defaults to `support.example.test`. For example,
+Acme receives mail at `acme@support.example.test`. Replies use a per-ticket
+private address at the same domain.
